  expected_sha256, copies bytearray/memoryview input, hashes it, parses and validates the frozen
  contract/profile/statistics and sets fields only from that parse; from_document_bytes is a thin
  wrapper; legacy hash+channels construction and dataclasses.replace raise TypeError. Regressions
