  forged-statistics rejection and forged-scaler/pinned-binding rejection.
- CP02: CurveSchema stored the caller list, so mutating it after builder construction changed the
  accepted field names. Fix: CurveSchema.__post_init__ validates all thirteen names (string type,
  forbidden tokens, duplicates) and copies values/valid into immutable tuples at construction; the
  builder keeps the frozen instance, so caller-list mutation or appends have no effect and renamed
  fields are rejected atomically.
